{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astro Prospector is an <strong>incremental bullet hell </strong>about mining cofferoids and fighting SpaceCorp. <strong>Collect</strong> resources, <strong>upgrade</strong> your ship and <strong>become</strong> unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine asteroids from SpaceCorp's fields and steal their AstroCoffee seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/FirstContact.gif?t=1746598729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and upgrade the skill tree to increase your ship power.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/English-Station.gif?t=1746598729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Machines will try to stop you. Dodge their bullets and destroy them. F*ck SpaceCorp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/GifBalas.gif?t=1746598729\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ Zones with unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new skills by completing tasks and destroying SpaceCorp Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short and intense experience (~4.0hr playtime).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our server Discord, so you can play early betas and give us feedback. You can find the link of the sidebar!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503440?t=1746598729","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st